  "description": "KAMMTAIL DESIGN\n\nIts front triangle has been redesigned since the previous model in order to improve air penetration. The rear chainstays are stiffer and lighter for maximum reactivity to pedalling. The frame is made entirely with the frame core removal technology known as Hollow Core Carbon Technology.\n\nACR STEERING\n\nThe AERO TT bike features ACR steering, enabling 100% internal cabling and ensuring very clean lines.\n\nFULL CARBON FORK\n\nThis offers an extra step for air to flow between the wheel and the frame without generating any turbulence.\n\n90 MM SEAT POST\n\nThe seat post has 90 mm travel to adapt to the needs of each triathlete.\n\nTYRE WIDTH CLEARANCE 28 MM\n\nIt offers 28 mm tyre width clearance; the optimal size for greater rigidity and safety, optimising the position of the brake.\n\nDI2 INCORPORATED\n\nThe battery is completely housed and hidden via a patented clip system inside the stem. It is discreet, light, insulated from humidity and easy to install.",
